            <ArticleTitle>Thallium poisoning. A case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>328-30</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A 21-year-old Black male with painful neuropathy, abdominal pain, tachycardia and encephalopathy developed striking scalp alopecia 1 week after admission. Thallium poisoning was suspected and confirmed by urinalysis. The clinical course, investigations and management are presented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
